WEBVTT

00:23.410 --> 00:30.380
It's right before your eyes... Just a little more...

00:30.630 --> 00:35.470
Your dream is right there.

00:36.180 --> 00:41.390
Only a small hunch...

00:41.640 --> 00:45.480
...keeps your hopes up now.

00:45.730 --> 00:50.860
In this endless, dark maze,

00:50.980 --> 00:54.990
strength is realizing...

00:55.740 --> 00:57.780
...your own weakness.

00:57.780 --> 01:01.120
Taking in the shining wind,

01:01.120 --> 01:06.120
you can fly...

01:06.670 --> 01:08.880
...towards the vast sky.

01:11.960 --> 01:15.970
When even the deepest darkness turns into light...

01:16.050 --> 01:23.560
...I believe in that instant.

01:24.230 --> 01:27.810
I'll keep on believing...

01:47.920 --> 01:50.590
<i>Attack! In the name of God!</i>

01:50.590 --> 01:54.130
<i>I have been told by God to save my France!</i>

02:04.970 --> 02:06.350
<i>Jeanne!</i>

02:16.240 --> 02:19.700
<i>You protected me... Hold on...</i>

02:19.700 --> 02:22.830
<i>Please! Don't die!</i>

02:29.920 --> 02:31.500
<i>That's right, Jeanne.</i>

02:31.500 --> 02:34.340
<i>Don't trust anyone.</i>

02:34.340 --> 02:36.590
<i>Everyone is your enemy.</i>

02:36.590 --> 02:40.720
<i>You mustn't trust anyone. Even God!</i>

02:47.600 --> 02:48.690
Chiaki!

02:52.560 --> 02:56.110
<i>What was that dream...?</i>

03:01.610 --> 03:05.200
<i>She doesn't remember anything, even after showing her that dream...</i>

03:06.200 --> 03:09.620
<i>As expected, Kusakabe Maron is not Jeanne d'Arc.</i>

03:09.620 --> 03:11.120
<i>Yes...</i>

03:11.120 --> 03:15.130
<i>She could not be Jeanne d'Arc.</i>

03:15.130 --> 03:17.670
<i>Please wait, Jeanne d'Arc.</i>

03:17.670 --> 03:23.140
<i>I will free your noble soul.</i>

03:30.480 --> 03:34.940
Evil Transformation! Myst's Assault

03:37.980 --> 03:40.900
Maron, hurry up!

03:40.900 --> 03:42.110
Coming...

03:44.120 --> 03:46.910
<i>I wonder why I saw that dream...</i>

03:51.460 --> 03:55.130
Don't trust anyone.

03:57.840 --> 04:01.510
My, my. Aren't you two all lovey-dovey this morning?

04:01.510 --> 04:05.010
But we're going to be late if you don't quit it!

04:05.010 --> 04:06.890
Oh, yeah...

04:06.890 --> 04:12.600
So when that thief heard that Detective Toudaiji and his daughter would be coming,

04:12.600 --> 04:15.060
he just ran off without stealing anything!

04:15.060 --> 04:19.070
Oh, yeah? There must be some wild rumor going around you, Miyako.

04:19.070 --> 04:20.360
What do you mean by that?!

04:21.400 --> 04:24.070
Everyone is your enemy.

04:29.580 --> 04:34.000
<i>What are you worried about, Maron? It was just a dream!</i>

04:36.130 --> 04:39.630
Good morning, Kusakabe-san! And everyone else.

04:39.630 --> 04:43.550
So everyone except Maron is just a sweeping generalization, Class President?

04:43.550 --> 04:46.890
- Um...well... Not exactly...

04:44.430 --> 04:46.890
<i>- That's right! It was just a dream!</i>

04:46.890 --> 04:50.310
<i>I have everyone! Friends!</i>

04:50.560 --> 04:51.720
- Maron!

04:50.560 --> 04:51.720
- Kusakabe-san!

04:51.720 --> 04:52.730
Hurry up!

04:54.020 --> 04:55.440
Coming!

04:55.440 --> 04:56.940
Hurry, we're going to be late!

04:56.940 --> 04:58.940
Let's run!

05:02.110 --> 05:04.780
<i>Today will be your last day, Jeanne.</i>

05:04.780 --> 05:08.030
<i>I'm not letting Queen have you!</i>

05:09.530 --> 05:12.750
What are you planning, Myst?

05:12.750 --> 05:16.960
It's none of your concern! Losers can just get out of my way.

05:16.960 --> 05:20.290
I haven't lost yet. Next time...

05:20.290 --> 05:21.960
Next time?

05:21.960 --> 05:26.300
Queen is coming. There is no next time!

05:26.300 --> 05:28.640
Don't get in my way like you did last time.

05:28.640 --> 05:31.470
Jeanne is my prey!

05:31.470 --> 05:32.850
I won't get in your way.

05:32.850 --> 05:38.150
Oh, really? Then, why did you implant a dream into Jeanne yesterday?

05:38.150 --> 05:42.610
Cheap tricks like that only disqualify you as a Demon.

05:43.480 --> 05:50.780
Oh, I'm sorry. You're just a human who sold his soul to the Devil, right?

05:50.780 --> 05:53.410
I have my own way of doing things.

05:53.410 --> 05:56.710
Too bad. You don't have any chances left.

05:56.710 --> 05:59.710
Jeanne is going to die today.

05:59.710 --> 06:03.300
I don't think you can do it.

06:03.300 --> 06:06.510
In order to break God's barrier that's protecting Jeanne...

06:06.510 --> 06:07.630
Shut up!

06:10.220 --> 06:14.220
It seems as though you don't understand the true horror of a real Demon.

06:15.180 --> 06:17.640
I'm finished with tedious plans!

06:17.640 --> 06:23.110
With every bit of power at my command, God's barrier that protects Jeanne...

06:23.110 --> 06:24.820
...will be destroyed!

06:24.820 --> 06:27.820
Jeanne is my prey!

06:27.820 --> 06:30.950
I'm not letting Queen kill her!

06:30.950 --> 06:32.070
Not Queen...!

06:41.130 --> 06:42.630
How foolish...

06:46.130 --> 06:51.890
In this way, the revolution, started by the English commoners, initiated the peak of capitalism.

06:51.890 --> 06:58.890
Eventually, through the invasion of European nations into Asia, the era of imperialism came to rise.

06:58.890 --> 07:02.270
Invasion into Asia... Imperialism...

07:02.270 --> 07:05.980
Don't they remind you of something, Kusakabe-san?!

07:05.980 --> 07:06.820
Huh?

07:06.820 --> 07:09.240
History repeats itself.

07:09.240 --> 07:11.240
Don't you remember?

07:11.240 --> 07:12.950
Let's see... um...

07:12.950 --> 07:14.910
- The Hundred Year War!

07:14.910 --> 07:20.790
It began when England tried to steal Flanders, which was an industrial area of France.

07:20.790 --> 07:25.590
In the end, France won and the basis of the King's autocracy was established.

07:25.590 --> 07:29.880
This brought forth an era of absolute rule and imperialism.

07:29.880 --> 07:33.430
Exactly. You remembered well...

07:33.430 --> 07:36.970
England captured much of northern France.

07:36.970 --> 07:42.440
However, a girl who claimed to hear the voice of God, Jeanne d'Arc, stood up...

07:42.440 --> 07:45.940
- ...and because of her, France was able to defeat England.

07:43.100 --> 07:45.940
- Jeanne d'Arc...

07:51.320 --> 07:56.740
Maron, you are the reincarnation of Jeanne d'Arc.

07:57.370 --> 08:01.500
Do you remember the fate of Jeanne d'Arc afterwards?

08:01.500 --> 08:06.040
She was captured by the English, and a religious trial was held.

08:06.040 --> 08:09.170
In the end, she was burned at the stake.

08:14.260 --> 08:17.180
It was because of Jeanne that the French won.

08:17.180 --> 08:21.100
Didn't anyone try to save her?

08:21.100 --> 08:25.350
Jeanne was the one to help Charles VII claim the throne of France.

08:25.350 --> 08:30.530
He could have saved her, but did not do so regardless.

08:33.400 --> 08:39.540
God Himself did not save Jeanne d'Arc, who fought in the name of God.

08:40.830 --> 08:44.670
I guess there is just no one you can trust.

08:49.170 --> 08:51.090
Now, in the other countries...

08:51.090 --> 08:53.880
<i>Don't trust anyone.</i>

08:53.880 --> 08:56.930
Everyone is your enemy! Even God!

09:02.180 --> 09:07.400
I wonder what's going on?!

09:14.200 --> 09:17.660
<i>Um... Sorry to interrupt class.</i>

09:17.660 --> 09:21.540
<i>This is the Momokuri Police Station's Detective Toudaiji of the Special Jeanne Task Force.</i>

09:21.540 --> 09:22.950
Dad!

09:22.950 --> 09:29.040
We just received a notice from Kaitou Jeanne that she planted a bomb in this school.

09:31.000 --> 09:34.470
That's a lie! Jeanne would never do such a thing!

09:35.880 --> 09:36.840
<i>Myst...!</i>

09:37.970 --> 09:42.100
Everyone, calm down! We must evacuate immeditately, just as we have practiced.

09:42.100 --> 09:45.890
Don't panic and stay in order. Understood?

09:54.650 --> 09:56.570
<i>Jeanne.</i>

09:56.570 --> 09:58.280
<i>Come to the library.</i>

09:58.280 --> 09:59.370
<i>Myst!</i>

10:00.320 --> 10:03.830
If you don't, I will blow up the school.

10:16.380 --> 10:19.430
<i>Blow up the school! I won't forgive that!</i>

10:19.430 --> 10:20.180
Maron!

10:21.180 --> 10:22.300
Chiaki!

10:22.300 --> 10:25.140
This is a trap! The Demon is after you!

10:25.140 --> 10:29.730
I know! But everyone is in danger because of me!

10:29.730 --> 10:31.560
I have to go!

10:31.560 --> 10:33.150
- Maron!

10:32.020 --> 10:33.150
- Chiaki!

10:32.020 --> 10:33.150
- Kusakabe-san!

10:33.150 --> 10:34.650
What are you doing?!

10:34.650 --> 10:35.730
Chiaki!

10:35.730 --> 10:36.940
What's the matter?

10:36.940 --> 10:39.780
Shikaido-sensei! Chiaki and Maron...!

10:40.570 --> 10:42.740
I'll go.

10:42.740 --> 10:45.790
You two must evacuate the school grounds.

10:45.790 --> 10:47.330
- But Sensei...

10:45.790 --> 10:47.330
- I'm going, too!

10:54.420 --> 10:58.170
<i>Watch my powers, Queen!</i>

10:58.170 --> 11:00.340
<i>I am Myst of the Demon Clan!</i>

11:00.340 --> 11:03.510
<i>A pure Demon, Myst!</i>

11:08.310 --> 11:09.730
Maron!

11:10.600 --> 11:12.610
Maron, where are you?!

11:14.940 --> 11:16.190
Sinbad!

11:16.190 --> 11:17.650
Access, what's the matter?!

11:17.650 --> 11:20.820
I feel like I'm inside a Demon's stomach!

11:20.820 --> 11:23.780
This one is nothing like the others!

11:23.780 --> 11:24.530
What about Maron?!

11:24.530 --> 11:26.620
She seems to have gone to the library.

11:26.620 --> 11:27.330
Okay!

11:27.330 --> 11:30.290
Sinbad, you won't stand a chance in this form!

11:30.290 --> 11:34.540
Geez! Blood just rushes to his head when a girl is involved!

11:34.540 --> 11:36.000
Wait, I said!

11:49.180 --> 11:52.560
<i>Such power! I need to transform quickly!</i>

11:53.940 --> 11:55.900
<i>Fin, lend me you power!</i>

11:55.900 --> 11:58.280
- <i>Deliver my wish to--</i>

11:56.650 --> 11:58.280
- Kusakabe...

11:58.280 --> 11:59.860
What are you doing?!

11:59.860 --> 12:01.530
I was worried about you.

12:01.530 --> 12:03.360
You're a bad girl, Maron-chan.

12:03.360 --> 12:05.570
You were told to evacuate.

12:05.570 --> 12:07.660
The orders given by us police officers...

12:07.660 --> 12:10.080
...must be obeyed.

12:10.080 --> 12:12.620
Please get out of the school.

12:12.620 --> 12:14.540
Now, Maron.

12:14.540 --> 12:18.130
Return the noble soul of Jeanne d'Arc.

12:18.130 --> 12:19.380
What?!

12:39.320 --> 12:44.570
I am a Pure Demon. I'm going to show you my powers!

12:51.370 --> 12:54.620
Now, give back the soul of Jeanne d'Arc.

13:01.840 --> 13:05.300
<i>- Death!</i>

13:02.380 --> 13:05.300
<i>- Death penalty!</i>

13:15.230 --> 13:21.940
Now, be a good girl. Do as I say and die, Maron-chan.

13:21.940 --> 13:24.030
Oji-sama...

13:24.450 --> 13:26.070
Maron!

13:29.490 --> 13:31.410
Now! Hurry!

13:35.040 --> 13:37.000
<i>Fin, lend me you power!</i>

13:37.000 --> 13:39.790
<i>Deliver my wish to Jeanne d'Arc!</i>

14:01.190 --> 14:03.400
<i>Strong and serious...</i>

14:03.400 --> 14:05.490
<i>Matchless and marvelous...</i>

14:05.490 --> 14:07.490
<i>Energetic and courageous!</i>

14:14.120 --> 14:17.870
<i>Kaitou Jeanne has arrived by the order of God!</i>

14:23.550 --> 14:25.590
Stop it, Sinbad!

14:26.840 --> 14:28.880
Everybody is being controlled by a Demon!

14:28.880 --> 14:31.010
Everyone here is an enemy!

14:32.350 --> 14:33.680
Stop!

14:43.820 --> 14:49.240
Now you know that there's no one you can trust in this world, Jeanne.

14:49.240 --> 14:52.450
Curse God in the pit of despair.

14:52.450 --> 14:54.620
When you do, you will...

14:56.620 --> 15:00.500
Don't trust anyone. Even God...

15:02.130 --> 15:03.840
<i>Everyone is your enemy.</i>

15:05.840 --> 15:09.800
There is just no one you can trust.

15:10.380 --> 15:13.100
Everyone is your enemy!

15:14.100 --> 15:15.510
<i>That can't be...!</i>

15:18.930 --> 15:20.270
No!

15:20.270 --> 15:21.350
Maron!

15:45.210 --> 15:49.880
You're finally here, Jeanne. This will be the end of you!

15:55.550 --> 15:57.060
In the name of God...

15:59.060 --> 16:01.520
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

16:03.190 --> 16:05.520
I seal you here!

16:08.530 --> 16:10.610
I can't <i>Checkmate!</i>

16:11.450 --> 16:14.910
Is that all of God's power?!

16:22.410 --> 16:24.460
I can...! I can do it!

16:24.460 --> 16:27.630
I, Myst of the Demon Clan, can kill Jeanne!

16:35.180 --> 16:39.220
<i>- God's barrier protecting Jeanne has grown weaker.</i>

16:39.850 --> 16:41.560
<i>This will be the end...</i>

16:41.560 --> 16:43.440
<i>It was quite boring.</i>

16:44.940 --> 16:51.110
<i>However, regardless of who kills Jeanne, the soul of Jeanne d'Arc will be freed.</i>

16:51.110 --> 16:55.200
<i>Oh, Jeanne d'Arc, in a short while...</i>

16:55.200 --> 16:56.780
Die!

17:05.170 --> 17:06.630
Sinbad!

17:06.630 --> 17:09.090
Why? You're a servant of the Devil...

17:18.140 --> 17:18.930
No!

17:30.770 --> 17:36.070
Like I said before! I <i>will</i> protect Maron!

17:38.410 --> 17:40.240
Hmph! Small fry...

17:42.700 --> 17:44.200
Sinbad!

17:57.590 --> 17:59.340
You're a persistent one...

17:59.340 --> 18:02.350
But play time is over!

18:07.640 --> 18:10.980
Maron... I will...

18:12.570 --> 18:13.690
Chiaki!

18:14.070 --> 18:15.650
Don't die!

18:31.840 --> 18:34.130
Die, Jeanne!

18:37.300 --> 18:38.590
What the...?!

18:55.070 --> 18:57.860
<i>Jeanne...d'Arc...</i>

19:02.160 --> 19:07.200
No! That girl could never be the noble Jeanne d'Arc!

19:08.540 --> 19:11.290
She's merely a girl...

19:11.290 --> 19:13.290
...that desecrates the soul of Jeanne d'Arc!!!

19:15.500 --> 19:16.710
Jeanne...

19:16.710 --> 19:17.800
Chiaki!

19:17.800 --> 19:20.050
Thank goodness! Chiaki!

19:24.760 --> 19:25.930
Myst!

19:25.930 --> 19:27.850
She's not dead yet!

19:34.190 --> 19:37.900
Die! The both of you will die!

19:38.990 --> 19:40.400
Where are you?!

19:40.400 --> 19:42.240
Myst, where are you?!

19:43.120 --> 19:43.870
Look out!

19:46.370 --> 19:46.990
Chiaki!

20:10.310 --> 20:11.600
- Noin...

20:11.600 --> 20:13.020
Noin!

20:14.100 --> 20:15.980
Accept the truth.

20:17.070 --> 20:22.240
You should know everything.

20:20.940 --> 20:22.240
- Jeanne d'Arc...<i></i>

20:32.500 --> 20:34.040
The candy box!

20:34.040 --> 20:35.000
Noin!

20:43.880 --> 20:45.300
In the name of God...

20:47.300 --> 20:49.810
You, a Demon, born in darkness...

20:53.230 --> 20:56.100
I seal you here!

20:57.900 --> 20:59.820
<i>Checkmate!</i>

21:40.480 --> 21:42.320
Kindness?

21:42.320 --> 21:45.820
One of these days, it will cost you your life.

21:46.910 --> 21:54.000
Soon, Queen will come and kill you.

22:09.430 --> 22:13.640
Why did you save me, Noin?

22:18.020 --> 22:19.650
I...

22:28.610 --> 22:35.200
The thick clouds past and the descending light...

22:36.000 --> 22:44.670
...slowly melts the hardened, damaged past.

22:45.260 --> 22:49.130
Because we live so stiffly,

22:49.130 --> 22:52.850
it's so easy to smash into pieces.

22:53.010 --> 23:01.980
And I never thought that I had anything to protect...

23:02.520 --> 23:05.690
Never forgetting...

23:05.980 --> 23:09.820
...there is unending love.

23:10.530 --> 23:14.580
I'll catch it, I'll steal it.

23:14.740 --> 23:17.870
Then embrace you with it.

23:18.160 --> 23:21.080
Even if there comes a time...

23:21.540 --> 23:26.050
...when this planet is destroyed,

23:26.250 --> 23:30.090
I won't be lonely, I won't be alone.

23:30.340 --> 23:37.890
I'll be embracing an eternal wind.

23:48.030 --> 23:51.150
Hello! Maron, I'm back!

23:51.150 --> 23:52.700
Fin! Is that you, Fin?!

23:52.700 --> 23:54.070
Where are you?!

23:54.070 --> 23:57.660
You haven't realized it yet, Kusakabe Maron?

23:58.540 --> 24:00.960
Right here. I'm right before your eyes.

24:00.960 --> 24:03.920
It can't be! Are you really Fin?!

24:04.580 --> 24:08.760
Kamikaze Kaitou Jeanne:  Reunion with Fin!! Dramatic Nightmare

24:08.760 --> 24:10.840
Yes, I'm Fin...

24:10.840 --> 24:13.220
...Fallen Angel Fin Fish!
